            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.4.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Meny 4:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.4.11+DEU.4.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Cik 4:11-12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Odikin ma ndelo mar'adek obedo mwoc koth gi lithkoth, aka pondeponde m'opoto oneno wi got, aka dwondi gwara ma malo owinjere. Ji je i kambi jokirin gi lworo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo Musa otelo ji wok i kambi romo gi Were, aka jocungo i tiendi got. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yiro oyido otweyo got gibe, kwoŋbedo Rwoth oloro iye i mac. Yiro oduny malo pa yiro ma wok i mac madwoŋ, aka ji je jokirin swa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dwondi gwara omedere malo. Musa oluwo aka Rwoth odwoko go gi mwoc koth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth oloro piny wi got Sinai aka olwoŋo Musa malo wi got. Musa oidho malo ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aka Rwoth owaco ri Musa ni, “Lori piny igwoki ji jokiri jowokal kew bino nenan rupiri madit kwoŋ jo jobino tho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiri jocway ri Were i wi migam ma jobino bongan je joripo lokirok macil, kosa abino miyo jo gir'acula.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
